sequenceDiagram

    participant IMU as MPU-9250
    participant STM32 as STM32H743ZI
    participant RTOS as FreeRTOS
    participant DRDY as DATA_READY
    participant IRQ as Jetson GPIO IRQ
    participant WQ as Linux Workqueue
    participant SPI as Jetson SPI Master
    participant FIFO as kfifo
    participant USER as telemetry_reader

    RTOS->>STM32: Schedule sensor task
    STM32->>IMU: Read accelerometer / gyroscope
    IMU-->>STM32: Return sensor registers

    STM32->>STM32: Store sensor sample
    STM32->>STM32: Build telemetry packet
    STM32->>STM32: Prepare SPI TX buffer
    STM32->>DRDY: Assert DATA_READY

    DRDY->>IRQ: Rising edge
    IRQ->>WQ: schedule_work()
    IRQ-->>DRDY: Return immediately

    WQ->>SPI: Start SPI transaction
    SPI->>STM32: Generate SPI clock
    STM32-->>SPI: Shift 36-byte packet
    SPI-->>WQ: Transfer complete

    WQ->>WQ: Validate MAGIC
    WQ->>FIFO: Push packet
    FIFO->>USER: Wake poll()/read()
    USER->>FIFO: Read packet
    USER->>USER: Decode real sensor values

    Note over IMU,USER: Repeat for each sensor sample
